ure","properties":{"layer_id":"cultural_facilities","name":"鏡石町営鳥見山陸上競技場","category":"public","address":"緑町199","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"07342","municipality_pref":"福島県","municipality_name":"鏡石町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.357947,37.247956]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"鳥見山公園","category":"nature","address":"岩瀬郡鏡石町","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"07342","municipality_pref":"福島県","municipality_name":"鏡石町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.35623433,37.24939272]}}],"display_comment_original":"鏡石町周辺には、近世村の記憶として鏡沼村、仁井田村、高久田村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には史跡や遺跡に関わる場所が見え、岩瀬牧場、方八丁遺跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、鏡沼村、仁井田村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに田・新田・用水の地名が多く、土地改良碑や用水記念碑が見つかる可能性がある。水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["鈴木省吾"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["岩瀬牧場","鏡沼（別名「かげ沼」）","田んぼアート"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%8F%A1%E7%9F%B3%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11649102"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"鏡石町","wikipedia_revision_id":"109868617","wikidata_qid":"Q1205431","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%8F%A1%E7%9F%B3%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}